  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p>Differentiating the above equation with respect to time,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Putting the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
